Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:38.63,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:42.97,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}胸が{\c&HA000FF&}沈{\c&FFFFFF&}んで未{\c&HA000FF&}来{\c&FFFFFF&}感じれなくなったり
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:47.97,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}時が{\c&HA000FF&}止{\c&FFFFFF&}まってもう終わったって{\c&HA000FF&}感{\c&FFFFFF&}じたり
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:54.47,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}塞ぎ{\c&HA000FF&}込{\c&FFFFFF&}んで　{\c&HA000FF&}話{\c&FFFFFF&}せなくて　じわり心の傘{\c&HA000FF&}が{\c&FFFFFF&}開いた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:58.09,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}それでも{\c&HA000FF&}強{\c&FFFFFF&}がって生きてた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:02.55,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}{\c&HA000FF&}慰{\c&FFFFFF&}めてなんて言わない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:07.59,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}強く{\c&HA000FF&}な{\c&FFFFFF&}って前を見て{\c&HA000FF&}た{\c&FFFFFF&}いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:14.13,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}だけど弱さが{\c&HA000FF&}押{\c&FFFFFF&}しつぶす
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:20.59,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}君{\c&HA000FF&}に{\c&FFFFFF&}会って世{\c&HA000FF&}界{\c&FFFFFF&}溢れて光与えてく{\c&HA000FF&}れ{\c&FFFFFF&}たり
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:25.34,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}少しだって{\c&HA000FF&}希{\c&FFFFFF&}望なかった僕が{\c&HA000FF&}笑{\c&FFFFFF&}えてたん{\c&HA000FF&}だ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:30.30,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}何気ない{\c&HA000FF&}会{\c&FFFFFF&}話でずっと笑{\c&HA000FF&}顔{\c&FFFFFF&}与えてくれたり
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:33.97,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}ありがとう{\c&HA000FF&}っ{\c&FFFFFF&}て照れて笑{\c&HA000FF&}う{\c&FFFFFF&}から言わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:35.59,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}だけど{\c&HA000FF&}思{\c&FFFFFF&}ってるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:39.38,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}この先{\c&HA000FF&}前{\c&FFFFFF&}向いていけ{\c&HA000FF&}る{\c&FFFFFF&}かな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.30,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}{\c&HA000FF&}光{\c&HFFFFFF&}よ　僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:38.63,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:42.97,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}胸口{\c&HA000FF&}沉{\c&FFFFFF&}重  我看不到{\c&HA000FF&}未{\c&FFFFFF&}來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:47.97,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}{\c&HA000FF&}時{\c&FFFFFF&}間停滯  感覺一{\c&HA000FF&}切{\c&FFFFFF&}都塵埃落定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:54.47,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}封{\c&HA000FF&}鎖{\c&FFFFFF&}自我  無人傾{\c&HA000FF&}訴{\c&FFFFFF&}  漸漸撐開{\c&HA000FF&}心{\c&FFFFFF&}的防護傘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:58.09,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}卻仍硬撐著{\c&HA000FF&}活{\c&FFFFFF&}下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:02.55,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}不需要{\c&HA000FF&}安{\c&FFFFFF&}慰的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:07.59,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}只想要{\c&HA000FF&}變{\c&FFFFFF&}強  一直向前{\c&HA000FF&}看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:14.13,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}然而軟{\c&HA000FF&}弱{\c&FFFFFF&}卻快將我壓垮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:20.59,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}與你{\c&HA000FF&}的{\c&FFFFFF&}相會讓我的世界{\c&HA000FF&}充{\c&FFFFFF&}滿光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:25.34,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}萬{\c&HA000FF&}念{\c&FFFFFF&}俱灰的我也能稍微{\c&HA000FF&}露{\c&FFFFFF&}出笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:30.30,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}即使是{\c&HA000FF&}平{\c&FFFFFF&}常的對話{\c&HA000FF&}仍{\c&FFFFFF&}讓我微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:33.97,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}不會道{\c&HA000FF&}謝{\c&FFFFFF&}  因為我會害羞想{\c&HA000FF&}笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:35.59,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}但我會時刻{\c&HA000FF&}思{\c&FFFFFF&}考
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:39.38,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}今{\c&HA000FF&}後{\c&FFFFFF&}我能否繼{\c&HA000FF&}續{\c&FFFFFF&}大步向前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.30,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}光啊  照耀{\c&HA000FF&}我{\c&FFFFFF&}吧
